</code></pre></div></div>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="BAEKJOON" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">가까운 공항 찾기</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2022/01/13/python_ml_01.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="가까운 공항 찾기" /><published>2022-01-13T23:50:43+09:00</published><updated>2022-01-13T23:50:43+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2022/01/13/python_ml_01</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2022/01/13/python_ml_01.html"><![CDATA[<p>주어진 세 공항들의 위도, 경도를 현재 위치의 위도, 경도와 비교하여 가장 가까운 공항을 찾는 문제입니다.</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>구분</th>
